@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 70 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "Recepciones" as R
concise "Lote" as B
concise "Instancia" as I

@0
R is "r1"
B is "abierto (lote N)"
I is "inactiva"

@1
R is "r2"

@2
R is "cierre"
B is "N cerrado"
I is "evaluar N"

@3
R is "r3"

@4
I is "consolidar + despachar N"

@5
R is "r4"

@6
R is "cierre"
B is "N+1 cerrado: r3, r4"
I is "evaluar N+1"

@7
R is "-"
I is "inactiva"

B@2 <-> @6 : r3 y r4 llegan tras el cierre -> esperan a N+1
@enduml
